# Architecture: DDD + CQRS + React

**Reference:** [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) Section 5-6 | [`SYSTEM_ARCHITECTURE.md`](../../docs/ai-guidelines/SYSTEM_ARCHITECTURE.md)

