## Bounded Contexts (Microservice-Like)

Each business domain is semi-independent:

| Context | Backend | Frontend | Key Rules |
|---------|---------|----------|-----------|
| **BOM** | domain/bom/ | modules/bom/ | Versioned, no duplicates |
| **Manufacturing** | domain/manufacturing/ | modules/manufacturing/ | Status machine |
| **Inventory** | domain/inventory/ | modules/inventory/ | Reservations, soft deletes |
| **Sales** | domain/sales/ | modules/sales/ | Approval workflow |
| **Procurement** | domain/procurement/ | modules/procurement/ | GRN ≤ PO qty |
| **Quality** | domain/quality/ | modules/quality/ | Inspections required |
| **Finance** | domain/finance/ | modules/finance/ | AR/AP tracking |
| **Tenant** | domain/tenant/ | modules/auth/ | Multi-tenancy |

**Cross-Context Communication:** Domain events only. Never direct coupling.

