## Event-Driven Communication

Domain events decouple contexts:

```
WorkOrder.complete()
  ↓
Raises WorkOrderCompletedEvent
  ↓
Event dispatcher publishes
  ↓
Subscribers listen:
  - Inventory service (consume materials)
  - Metrics service (update KPIs)
  - Notification service (alert users)
  - WebSocket handler (real-time UI update)
```

